Welcome to this part of A practical RAG classroom handbook. Our focus is ingestion and evidence. The fictional Atlas classroom collection contains travel guides, policy notes, diagrams and transcripts. Its reference code is ATLAS-LAB-73. Each upload is parsed into readable text before chunking. Image understanding should describe visible relationships and labels; it must not invent values obscured in a chart.

